      <section class="bg-[#F9F9FA] px-[8%] py-[15%] md:py-[8%]">
        <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1450px] flex-col gap-10 lg:flex-row">
          <div class="rounded-[30px] bg-white p-[25px] md:p-[50px] lg:w-1/2">
            <h2 class="pb-5 text-[30px] font-semibold md:text-[40px]">About Precon</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4 text-[16px] font-normal leading-relaxed">
              <p>In response to the changing work landscape spurred by Covid-19, Precon was born in 2020. The sudden transition to remote work has propelled industries to adapt and explore innovative staffing solutions. What used to be confined to routine tasks now extends to specialized domains like preconstruction, and Precon is here to guide you through this transition.</p>
              <p>With a keen focus on the United States, we tap into India’s abundant pool of dedicated and cost-effective construction professionals. These experts seamlessly align with your time zones, ensuring effective communication and a collaborative approach.</p>
              <p>To assist small and medium-sized businesses in navigating this evolving landscape, we’ve partnered with Precon Labor LLC, our US sales representative. This collaboration streamlines the process for you, enabling you to harness remote labor more swiftly and effectively. Together, let’s embrace the changing horizon and leverage the advantages of remote staffing for your business success.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="min-h-[280px] rounded-[30px] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat lg:w-1/2 lg:min-h-[480px]" style="background-image:url('https://preconindia.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/precon-90-64ee30e76a7b1.webp')"></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="faq" class="bg-white px-[8%] py-[15%] md:px-[6%] md:py-[8%]">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]">
          <p class="text-center text-[18px] font-normal text-accent">FAQ</p>
          <h2 class="mb-10 text-center text-[30px] font-semibold text-ink md:text-[50px]">Questions about remote staffing?</h2>
